WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.250
The house at the end of the lane kept a lamp in the front window.

2
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:11.979
Each evening the lamp was lit before the street grew dark.

3
00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:18.459
Neighbors used it as a marker when the fog came in from the river.

4
00:00:18.739 --> 00:00:24.861
A child walking home counted the gates until the light appeared.

5
00:00:25.141 --> 00:00:31.414
The wick was trimmed every Sunday and the glass was wiped clean.

6
00:00:31.694 --> 00:00:36.322
No one remembered who had started the custom.

7
00:00:36.602 --> 00:00:41.003
They only knew the window should not go dark.

8
00:00:41.283 --> 00:00:47.184
On the night of the first frost, the lamp burned until morning.
